s, fresh from the farms! Ramanagara has the biggest cocoon market in the country.","The silkworms do all the work. I just do the shouting."]}]},{"id":"rm_vulture","x":25,"y":6,"sprite":"birdwatcher","facing":"LEFT","movement":"IDLE","script":[{"say":["Long-billed vultures nest on these cliffs. One of the last places in the world they still do.","Ugly? Maybe. But they keep the land clean. Respect the vulture."]}]}],"signs":[{"x":40,"y":13,"text":"RAMANAGARA - Silk town of the south. These granite hills are older than the dinosaurs, and twice as grumpy."},{"x":12,"y":27,"style":"stone","text":"THE YALI GALLERY. A temple hall older than anyone remembers. The stone lions are said to wake when the land needs them."},{"x":18,"y":8,"style":"stone","text":"RAMADEVARA BETTA. The highest boulder bakes in the sun all year round. Villagers leave it buttermilk. It never says thank you."}],"items":[{"id":"rm_pak","x":4,"y":4,"item":"Mysore Pak","qty":2},{"id":"rm_sdabba","x":28,"y":5,"item":"Steel Dabba","qty":3},{"id":"rm_tiffin","x":40,"y":30,"item":"Tiffin Carrier"}],"triggers":[],"counters":[],"interactables":[{"x":21,"y":6,"requires":{"not":"BISILU_DONE"},"script":[{"cutscene":true},{"say":"The granite is too hot to touch. The air shimmers like a mirage..."},{"say":"A lion of sun-baked stone opens its molten eyes!"},{"cutscene":false},{"battle":{"wild":{"species":147,"level":58},"music":"MUSIC_LEGEND","environment":"hill"},"onWin":[{"setFlag":"BISILU_DONE"},{"if":{"caught":147},"then":[{"say":"The spirit of summer settles warmly into its Dabba."}],"else":[{"say":"Bisilu shakes its blazing mane and melts into the heat haze."}]}],"onLose":[]}]}],"encounters":{},"water":[],"onEnter":null,"spawn":null,"metroStation":null,"respawnText":null}}